legacy_export_entities.description:
These DynTarNL entities are used in an automation or script:
{entities}

They keep working unchanged in 1.x. They show the dynamic feed-in compensation (market − markup) and do not know netting, feed-in costs or contract types. The sell entities (sell_*) and the sell table do, and replace them in 2.0. Switch your automations and scripts to the entity after the arrow.
